DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     zzmmaann is the manual browser of the COHERENT GUI.  It must be
     run under the zzvviieeww desktop.  It lists every pre-formatted
     manual page installed under /uussrr/mmaann in a multi-column
     catalog, and shows the selected page - with bold and under-
     lining - in the pane below.  zzmmaann takes no page argument on
     the command line; it accepts the standard window _o_p_t_i_o_n_s of
     GUI applications; see zzvviieeww.

     The find field in the top bar always has the keyboard focus:
     printable characters are appended to it, and RETURN (or the
     FFiinndd button) jumps to the named page - by exact name first,
     then to the first page of which the typed text is a prefix.
     Matching is case-sensitive.  The remaining keys:

                ^PP, ^NN        select the previous / next page
                ^ZZ, ^BB        page the text up
                ^VV, ^FF        page the text down
                BBSS, DDEELL       erase the last character of the find field
                ^UU            clear the find field

     Because every printable character goes to the find field,
     SPACE types a space rather than paging.

     With the mouse, a single click in the catalog loads the page
     under the pointer; the two scrollbars on the left edge
     scroll the catalog and the text.  A left drag in the text
     pane selects text and publishes it as the PRIMARY selection
     on release, for pasting into other windows with a middle
     click.

