     The catalog is scanned once at start-up; pages installed
     later do not appear until zzmmaann is restarted.  It holds at
     most 250 pages from at most 8 section directories (those
     named *mmaann). A page shows at most 600 lines of 200 columns,
     and the find field holds 14 characters.  zzmmaann only reads the
     pre-formatted pages; it never runs nnrrooffff.
